# Before touching a repo

Replace this body with your local repo conventions. For example:

- All repos are symlinked under a single known folder; look there first before cloning from GitHub or GitLab.
- If the repo isn't present locally, ask the user which canonical clone to use.
- Never assume a repo only exists remotely.
